cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Presensi Wajah: Sistem Presensi Kuliah Berbasis Pengenalan Wajah di Peramban"
abstract: >
  Face-recognition attendance system for university classes, consisting of a static,
  build-free frontend (app-presensi) and a Cloudflare Workers + D1 backend (api-presensi).
  Face feature extraction (face-api.js: TinyFaceDetector, 68 landmarks, 128-D descriptor) runs
  entirely in the browser; only the encrypted descriptor is stored on the server, never images
  or video. Includes active liveness challenges (blink / turn left / turn right), explicit
  biometric consent, role-based access (student, lecturer, admin), per-meeting reports with
  manual override, and CSV export. Automated tests so far use mocked face models; calibration
  with real cameras and faces is pending.
